# https://w3id.org/vcf-rdfizer/
#
# RETIRED namespace of the VCF-RDFizer Vocabulary, versions 1.0.x and 1.1.0.
# The vocabulary continues as the VCF Core Vocabulary at
# https://w3id.org/vcf-core/ so that the model is identified independently of
# any one converter.
#
# Maintainer: Elias Crum <elias.crum@ugent.be>
#             IDLab, Ghent University - imec, Belgium
# Source:     https://github.com/ecrum19/vcf-core-vocabulary
#
# DELIBERATELY NOT A REDIRECT TO THE NEW NAMESPACE. Every IRI under this
# namespace resolves to a legacy document in which that IRI is still defined,
# deprecated, and linked to its successor with owl:equivalentClass,
# owl:equivalentProperty or owl:sameAs. 

Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Retired vocabulary. Fragment IRIs dereference here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RewriteRule ^vocab/?$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecrum19/VCF-RDFizer-vocabulary/main/legacy/legacy-vcf-rdfizer.ttl [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^vocab\.ttl$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecrum19/VCF-RDFizer-vocabulary/main/legacy/legacy-vcf-rdfizer.ttl [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^vocab/[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+/?$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecrum19/VCF-RDFizer-vocabulary/main/legacy/legacy-vcf-rdfizer.ttl [R=302,L]

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Retired instance IRI space. Never published; nothing to serve.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RewriteRule ^vcf/ - [R=410,L]

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything else under the retired namespace: the deprecation record.
# A human visiting the bare namespace is sent to the successor's documentation.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RewriteRule ^$ https://w3id.org/vcf-core/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ecrum19/VCF-RDFizer-vocabulary/main/legacy/legacy-vcf-rdfizer.ttl [R=302,L]
